WEBVTT

00:04:28.996 --> 00:04:32.704
"Say it loud, I'm Black and I'm proud."

00:04:32.704 --> 00:04:34.746
(Applause)

00:04:34.788 --> 00:04:35.954
He did it for us,

00:04:35.954 --> 00:04:38.079
that became our national anthem.

00:04:39.496 --> 00:04:41.829
And recently,

00:04:41.871 --> 00:04:45.204
I attended the estate sale

00:04:45.204 --> 00:04:48.829
of "Porgy and Bess's" Etta Moten Barnett,

00:04:48.871 --> 00:04:51.371
she had the famous contralto voice.

00:04:51.913 --> 00:04:55.121
And her husband,
Claude Barnett, Pan-Africanist,

00:04:55.163 --> 00:04:58.913
who was founder
of the Associated Negro Press,

00:04:58.913 --> 00:05:02.454
in their home, literally,